    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Occupying a convenient site on one of Sandymount’s most prestigious and sought-after residential roads, the former Ailesbury Nursing Home at 58 Park Avenue presents a rare and versatile opportunity for the discerning investor or developer. This substantial period property is offered with full vacant possession and boasts an impressive footprint of approximately 916 square meters (9,850 square feet).\r\n\r\n The building has been well maintained and is presented in good decorative order throughout, combining the character of its original era with the functional requirements of a high-capacity facility.\r\n \r\nThe interior accommodation is thoughtfully arranged, beginning with a bright conservatory-style entrance porch that leads into a grand reception hall featuring a dedicated greeting desk. \r\n\r\nThe expansive layout currently comprises 26 bedrooms of varying dimensions, complemented by ample bathroom facilities and five generous reception rooms. \r\n\r\nPracticality is further enhanced by comprehensive staff offices, break rooms, and a commercial kitchen. \r\n\r\nBeyond the main residence, a separate single-story annex to the rear houses a modern plant room along with additional storage and versatile utility  & staff room space.\r\n \r\nThe property’s scale and existing multi-occupancy configuration offer versatile accommodation for many uses. This investment property offers a clear opportunity to generate significant rental income or to be repurposed for a wide variety of accommodation uses, (subject to the relevant permissions if required). \r\n\r\nPark Avenue Sandymount is a prime location , situated just a short stroll from the vibrant atmosphere of Sandymount Village and the coastal beauty of the Strand, within minutes of St. Vincent’s University Hospital and the city centre.\r\n \r\nThis is a blue-chip offering in the heart of Dublin 4, supported by a valid fire safety certificate with detailed architectural plans available upon request.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the sheer scale and potential of this prime investment property and is available by appointment with Conor Gallagher, Gallagher Quigley Tel: +35318183000 or email to info@GallagherQuigley.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "26 Bedrooms\r\n5 reception rooms \r\nAmple bathrooms / staff facilities \r\nPrivate off street parking / on street parking\r\nB3 energy rating \r\nPrime location close to - Sandymount village , Dart, St Vincent's Hospital, within 4km of UCD and Trinity\r\nClose to east link / port tunnel - convenient access to Dublin International airport \r\nClose to Bus terminal at nearby St John’s Church (Outside 58 Park Ave)\r\nMaintained grounds and garden\r\nSuitable for many uses \r\nPresented in good order \r\nAvailable with full vacant possession"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
